    "label": {
      "en": "Basic insurance pension: tscsepi and tscse"
    },
    "short_label": {
      "en": "$BasicPens"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "Basic (flat-rate) social insurance pension amount, currently EUR 355.81/month, used in tscse_lt and boa00_lt to compute pension-insurance-related tax/benefit adjustments, e.g. the 'pension insurance' formula in tscse_lt/ArithOp and the 'recalculate bdict' step in boa00_lt/BenCalc. The benefits theme document covers non-pension cash benefits and does not describe pension parameters, so this description is derived mainly from the constant's name, label and usage sites."
    },
    "explanation": {
      "en": "EUROMOD function group: Pension age, MMS, AMS, AMSp,  BSA, SSI, CYI, CBN, basic/asistance pensions bases, RP"
    },
